        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCFAV19, Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate has a timeless, traditional look that is well suited to historic homes. This knobset has one of Grandeur's Arc Tall Plates, so named for their bigger profile. At 11 inches tall, the Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Plate will look nice on large doors or doors that open into large rooms. The Arc Tall Plate with Fifth Avenue Knob is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/half-round-knob-with-arc-tall-plate-single-cylinder-entryset-grandeur-arcfav19entr\"><b>Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue Knob with Arched Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCFAV19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262390\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCFAV19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
