                "title": "Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate",
                "description": "The Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate has a timeless, traditional look that is well suited to historic homes. This knobset has one of Grandeur's Arc Tall Plates, so named for their bigger profile. At 11 inches tall, the Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Plate will look nice on large doors or doors that open into large rooms. The Arc Tall Plate with Fifth Avenue Knob is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
